      "ja": "蒸気発生<br>このクラスにおいては，下記の用語は以下に示す意味で用いる:<br>―蒸気は，また他の凝縮性蒸気，例．水銀，ジフェニル，ジフェニル配化物を包含する。",
      "en": "STEAM GENERATION<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this class the following term is used with the meaning indicated: <br>\"steam\" covers also other condensable vapours, e.g. mercury,  diphenyl, diphenyl oxide.",
      "count": 0,
